# fetches per-pair cutouts).
reproductions/hsu-2025/data/zall-pix-iron.fits
reproductions/hsu-2025/data/zpix-sv3-dark.fits
reproductions/hsu-2025/data/fastspecfit/
reproductions/hsu-2025/figs/cutouts_jpeg_dr10/
reproductions/hsu-2025/figs/cutouts_fits_dr10/

# Heavy DECaLS cutouts for Huang-2020 reproduction — regenerable via
